{"page":347,"verses":[{"verse_key":"23:75","surah":23,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَوْ رَحِمْنَـٰهُمْ وَكَشَفْنَا مَا بِهِم مِّن ضُرٍّ لَّلَجُّوا۟ فِى طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ يَعْمَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Even if We were to show them mercy and relieve them of distress, they would blindly persist in their transgression.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَحِمْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We had mercy on them","transliteration":"raḥim'nāhum","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَشَفْنَا","en_gloss":"and We removed","transliteration":"wakashafnā","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِم","en_gloss":"(was) on them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ضُرٍّۢ","en_gloss":"(the) hardship","transliteration":"ḍurrin","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَّلَجُّوا۟","en_gloss":"surely they would persist","transliteration":"lalajjū","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":10,"ar":"طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their transgression","transliteration":"ṭugh'yānihim","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْمَهُونَ","en_gloss":"wandering blindly","transliteration":"yaʿmahūna","verse_key":"23:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٥","en_gloss":"(75)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:75"}]},{"verse_key":"23:76","surah":23,"ayah":76,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَخَذْنَـٰهُم بِٱلْعَذَابِ فَمَا ٱسْتَكَانُوا۟ لِرَبِّهِمْ وَمَا يَتَضَرَّعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have already afflicted them, yet they did not submit to their Lord: they will not humble themselves","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"We seized them","transliteration":"akhadhnāhum","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"with the punishment","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱسْتَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they submit","transliteration":"is'takānū","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِرَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"to their Lord","transliteration":"lirabbihim","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَتَضَرَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"they supplicate humbly","transliteration":"yataḍarraʿūna","verse_key":"23:76"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧٦","en_gloss":"(76)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:76"}]},{"verse_key":"23:77","surah":23,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا فَتَحْنَا عَلَيْهِم بَابًا ذَا عَذَابٍ شَدِيدٍ إِذَا هُمْ فِيهِ مُبْلِسُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"until We open a gate to severe torment for them- then they will be plunged into utter despair.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَتَحْنَا","en_gloss":"We opened","transliteration":"fataḥnā","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a gate","transliteration":"bāban","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَا","en_gloss":"of a punishment","transliteration":"dhā","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَذَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"of a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَدِيدٍ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdin","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"They","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"23:77"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīh